<!-- §tile-icons (post-v1.0): the Quick Share "Apps" tile glyph — the app-
     grid mark: four rounded squares, the top-right one rendered SOLID with
     a play-triangle KNOCKOUT (fillType evenOdd) so the grid reads as
     "launchable applications", not a generic table. Replaces the flat
     Android robot head that read as an OS logo rather than "your installed
     apps". Pass-2 refinement: the solid tile now actually carries the play
     notch its design called for — a subtractive triangle, zero extra ink,
     legible at 22-24dp. -->
